cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SynthonOR: minimal standalone RDKit synthon-OR similarity search"
abstract: >-
  SynthonOR is an open-source synthon similarity search using a bitwise-OR
  strategy with support for generic RDKit fingerprints (ECFP4, RDKit, atom pair,
  topological torsion, and more), reusable on-disk caches, and reaction-grounded
  retrieval over very large synthon combinatorial spaces.
type: software
